          "translation": "ကျွန်တော်/ကျွန်မ အဆင်သင့်ဖြစ်နေပါပြီ။"
        },
        {
          "pattern": "he / she / it + is",
          "example": {
            "language": "en",
            "text": "She is a teacher."
          },
          "translation": "သူက ဆရာမတစ်ဦးပါ။"
        },
        {
          "pattern": "you / we / they + are",
          "example": {
            "language": "en",
            "text": "You are a student."
